2026-10-11T05:23:23.1244093Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1343798Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1354342Z [0m
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1355088Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1355949Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1356342Z 
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1357103Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1358339Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1358835Z 
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1359286Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1360019Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1360325Z 
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1361143Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1361766Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1362231Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1362572Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1362733Z 
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1362957Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1363218Z 
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1363487Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1363857Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1364203Z 
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1364322Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1364480Z 
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1364869Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1365391Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1367388Z 
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1367698Z I will:
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1367894Z 
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1368434Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1369226Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1370004Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1370434Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1370713Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1371034Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1371551Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1371915Z    /root
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1383718Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1384251Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1394929Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1395470Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1395964Z 
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1397200Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-11T05:23:23.1398137Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
